Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:02.35,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Dear students,{consistency 64}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:08.61,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I would like to introduce our new art teacher.{consistency 64}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.41,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,A-Ajimi-chan?!{consistency 64}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:14.23,PriPara,Others,0,0,0,,She's a teacher?!{consistency 64}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:15.92,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's older than us?!{consistency 64}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:17.84,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Roger!{ﾎﾟｱﾝ！ ????? TLC}{consistency 64}{group name later on}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:20.40,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Yehellow!{consistency 64}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:26.42,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I'm your art teacher, Kiki Ajimi-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:30.80,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Students, she may be a bit unique, but please welco{\fscx300}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:33.55,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Phantom Thief Genius, you're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:35.01,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,DaVinci cuffing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:37.60,PriPara,Students,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:40.56,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Headmistress Ookanda is Phantom Thief Genius?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:46.52,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,MunGreco!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:48.98,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:52.75,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,To mix me up with Phantom Thief Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:56.32,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,You're not-daVinci?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:59.18,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Of course not! The phantom thief is a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:00.16,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Oh ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.33,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I made a mistake-daVinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:05.12,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Silly me-david.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:41.18,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Da Vinci Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:47.73,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's only a week until AutDrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:58.40,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Cyalume Charm put together a five person team\N without any regard for established ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:01.61,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that how it's going to continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:04.95,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Friends will fall {to}by the wayside...{consistency 57}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:08.79,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's almost like what \NPhantom Thief Genius said is coming true...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.45,0:03:10.25,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,It's Ms. Ajimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:10.86,PriPara,Rand2,0,0,0,,It's Ms. Ajimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:11.61,PriPara,Rand3,0,0,0,,It's Ms. Ajimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.10,PriPara,Rand4,0,0,0,,It's Ms. Ajimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:14.94,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:19.21,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:20.76,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:27.77,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,U-Um, Ms. Ajimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.35,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,please start class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.13,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Ms. Ajimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:35.31,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,She is currently meditating-daVinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:36.33,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Meditating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:38.26,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Minami, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:39.28,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Ms. Ajimi has...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.24,PriPara,Minami,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:42.88,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Y-You want me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:43.95,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:45.01,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:49.95,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Paprika Academy rule number 557: "Teachers are not allowed to meditate during cl{\fscx300}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:53.42,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,T-T-T-Tada! Now awake and ready to draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:57.57,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Ms. Ajimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:03:59.76,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Don't paint all over the classroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:01.93,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Minami, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.93,0:04:04.22,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,In order to win the AutDrea...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:05.84,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:10.47,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,The only thing in Minami's head\N is the Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:11.77,PriPara,Amamiya,0,0,0,,AutDrea for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:15.73,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:17.74,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Ch-Ch-Ch-Chagall!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.96,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, Ms. Ajimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:21.15,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What's the commotion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:23.36,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,Is the final war upon us?!{She mentioned this in 59 as well}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:24.49,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.82,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Cut it out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:29.00,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Ch-Ch-Ch-Chagall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.29,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Glittering Picasso.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:35.65,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You're prohibited from holding a paintbrush\N while you're in school from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:37.54,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Sorry-cézanne.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:40.55,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,She's really letting Ms. Ajimi have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:44.76,PriPara2,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\an8}For many years, Paprika Academy has done its best to protect its long-running school traditions of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:49.57,PriPara2,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\an8}...purity, discipline, and excellency...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:47.25,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,The right fox barks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:49.57,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,The left fox barks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.57,0:04:51.69,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,At least listen to me when I'm talking,\N or you'll just cause more problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:53.43,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Cause more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:56.93,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Cause more... Cause mo... Cosmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:04:57.89,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:01.82,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,I came to Parajuku city to see Cosmo-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:04.70,PriPara2,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Hey! Cosmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.25,PriPara2,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cosmo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:07.53,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Hey now! I'm not done talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:10.24,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cosmo! Cosmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:12.95,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Did you cosmically call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:16.17,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Cosmo! I found you-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:19.86,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,I heard that you're the art teacher here now, Ajimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.26,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,So I secretly came to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:22.44,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.01,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,I missed you-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:24.85,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:26.57,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,They know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.09,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,That's surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:29.87,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Did you know, Sophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.09,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:38.42,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,I came here to have a competition with Cosmo-da Vinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:39.66,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Match?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:41.22,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:45.22,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,We haven't finished our last competition yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:46.40,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:52.06,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,It happened seven years ago, before Sophy had made her PriPara début,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:58.37,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,when numerous artists from Prance's PriParis gathered at MontParanasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:06.88,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Ajimi and I were students at the foremost\N design academy, PriParis Mode Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:11.39,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,When we were together, we motivated each other\N to work hard and improve ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:15.31,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,We would also battle in the café until morning-daVinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:20.27,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,And while we were enrolled there, we put our works on display at the design concours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.27,0:06:25.74,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,And the two who made it to the finals\N were Cosmo and me-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:30.64,PriPara,RandAnnouncer,0,0,0,,Our first place winners are \NAjimi Kiki and Cosmo Houjou-jen'nu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:33.20,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's a tie-s'il Vous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:38.37,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Our competition ended up continuing beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:43.01,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,But we ended up going our \Nseparate ways after our graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:44.72,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.77,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,That's the match you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:50.22,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was only 8-years-old back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:53.30,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,and since I lived in a condo in Parajuku City with my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:54.25,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:07:00.98,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I traveled the world and refined my skills after I graduated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:03.80,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,The Gobi Desert was the last place I managed to reach-dali.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:04.84,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I made it-dali.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:08.78,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,And that's when I got \Na bunch of sentence enders-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:11.00,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's Gauguin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:12.79,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,See that-millet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.79,0:07:14.98,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Where Renoir you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:17.20,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Silly me-david.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:19.20,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,How much-familia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:22.67,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Fare-Raphael-well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:25.80,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Just what did she learn?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:29.85,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,And because of that, I powered up-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.72,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,All to be able to challenge Cosmo\N to another match-de Venus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.82,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,Her way of talking is rather confusing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:37.73,PriPara,Mirai,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:40.69,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,All right then, Ajimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:42.36,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:44.90,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,I'll cosmically accept your challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:46.73,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Hooray-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:49.45,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,The AuDrea will take place in one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:52.28,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,We'll have a teracosmic match there with our coords!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:54.62,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Okay-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:59.16,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,When it comes to a coord battle,\N the model is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:03.65,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,But... are you sure I'm the right fit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:05.21,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:08.42,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:10.88,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,I'll try asking someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.28,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,There you are, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.53,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,This is the best cosmic timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:18.41,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:22.85,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,So, would you like to be a model\N for the famous designer Cosmo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:24.38,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Model?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:28.86,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Well, you must have a good eye to have picked me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:29.86,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,but I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:32.21,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'm busy with idol stuff right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.21,0:08:32.57,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:36.53,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,But talent like yours only comes around every 5,000 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:40.16,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,I really think you'd look great all dressed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:44.12,PriPara,Cosmos,0,0,0,,You'd be super cosmic gorgeous and \Nimpress the entire audience with your charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:45.00,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:52.00,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Today's speciality Chinese buns are omelette rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.80,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan wants to try one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:54.51,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:57.47,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Lookie! An omelette rice bun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:08:59.46,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:00.97,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:05.69,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Gotcha model-da Vinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:17.61,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Ajimi vs. Cosmo\N AutDrea Coord Showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:21.08,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,And your two impromptu hosts\N for today are me, Kuma, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.52,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:25.81,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Even with the AuDrea coming up, it's the idol who just can't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:27.63,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:33.57,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,All right, first we have one from Cosmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:38.77,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Made from just lick-able candy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:41.16,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,we have the Lick-able Candy Circular Coord-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:43.81,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,With it's poppin' colours, it sure feels like autumn-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:48.44,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Well? I'm the super gorgeous Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:51.12,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Next up is Ajimi's design!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:56.49,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Here we have a doughnut!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:58.61,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,It looks really sweet and delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:00.96,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,The Marble Doughnuts Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.99,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Can't eat it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:09.29,PriPara,SignPostThing,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:11.37,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Looks to be a draw-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.72,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Wanna go flower picking with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:18.09,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,The Spring Coming Cherry Coord-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:20.76,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,And after we go flower picking,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:22.78,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,we can go Kung-Fu fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.93,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce China Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:28.95,PriPara,SignPostThing,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:30.65,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Another tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:32.74,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,This is the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.51,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,If a cat and a spade were to cross paths,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:36.51,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,the result would be the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.51,0:10:38.49,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Heart Eye Devil Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:41.00,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,And over here is a heart cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.91,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Cute-meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.20,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Heart Eye Angel Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:46.36,PriPara,SignPostThing,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:47.91,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Another tie-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:50.17,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,That's Cosmo for you-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:53.13,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,It's Ajimi. Of course she's going to be hard to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:55.09,PriPara2,SignPostThing,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:55.09,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Another tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:56.84,PriPara2,SignPostThing,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:56.84,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Another tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:57.71,PriPara2,SignPostThing,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:58.63,PriPara,Lama,0,0,0,,Another tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:02.47,PriPara,Cojiri,0,0,0,,There's no end!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.49,0:11:16.14,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:19.53,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,She's been thinking so hard that her face froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.51,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's been pushed into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:28.45,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,I'm cosmically out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:32.17,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,The two of you have quite the faces right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.66,0:11:36.86,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It must be something they learned while studying art...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:38.36,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:41.57,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's the troubled face they make when they're starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:42.38,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Starving?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:45.47,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Why don't we feed them omelette rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:46.76,PriPara,Larothy,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.09,0:11:48.67,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,After they fill their stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.60,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll have all kinds of good ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:52.65,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.65,0:11:54.21,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Let's make omelette rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:55.73,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Capsice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:00.64,PriPara,Tori,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.64,0:12:04.11,PriPara,Tori,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat the egg that Toriko produced-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:07.08,PriPara,3,0,0,0,,Omelette rice! Omelette rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:10.27,PriPara,3,0,0,0,,Pardon us, but we'd like some eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.27,0:12:11.48,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.01,0:12:13.55,PriPara,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko's egg...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:16.04,PriPara,Toriko,0,0,0,,No one wants Toriko's egg-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:19.17,PriPara,Toriko,0,0,0,,At any rate, when you're alone you can\N only produce an unfertilized egg-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:22.80,PriPara,Toriko,0,0,0,,Since no one likes Toriko's eggs, \Nthey might as well just eat her-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:24.61,PriPara,Toriko,0,0,0,,Might as well add the seasoning, too-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:27.14,PriPara,Toriko,0,0,0,,All right, Toriko is prepared-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:30.10,PriPara,3,0,0,0,,Omelette rice! Omelette rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:31.83,PriPara,3,0,0,0,,Chicken meat please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:32.47,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Yeppers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:34.06,PriPara,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:35.43,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:36.79,PriPara,Rand2,0,0,0,,Where's the next coord?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:38.02,PriPara,Rand3,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.25,PriPara,Rand4,0,0,0,,Is there more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.65,PriPara,Rand5,0,0,0,,Explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:42.53,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Calm yourselves, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:46.18,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Don't ruin such cute faces such an angry expression-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:50.06,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,If you don't play nice, \NI won't make a move on you-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:50.96,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:52.10,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,As if we want you to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:54.50,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,That won't make us popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:54.50,PriPara2,Kuma,0,0,0,,Forgive me! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:55.76,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:58.61,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,Show us the next coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:14.18,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,D-D-DaVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:16.10,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Leave it Cézanne to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.81,0:13:27.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Gel...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:36.33,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:39.75,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:45.49,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This outfit has been designed\Nwith five colourful patchwork bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:47.61,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I wonder if you can find all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:51.51,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Handmade Friends Bear-san Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:53.02,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,DaVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.05,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,I got it-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.05,0:13:58.00,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,You want to see it that bad, huh-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.84,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma's short story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:01.54,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma's Corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.23,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,You like it-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:05.54,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:07.33,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Behind you-chagall!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:07.95,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.55,0:14:11.41,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:17.31,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Next up is the best coord ever-renoirDaVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:18.96,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,But first listen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:21.92,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,...this song-queSeraSera da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:13.51,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)\i1}Cosmo, I'm so glad I met you-da Vinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.50,0:15:16.60,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)\i1}Back then, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:35.78,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DaVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:39.20,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:46.02,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Snip, snip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:51.45,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:55.50,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(810,990)}Cutout Plushy Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:16:00.54,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:06.78,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,997.5)}DaVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:33.93,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to return to that time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:35.61,PriPara2,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:43.27,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel like I'm about to remember it dali-da Vinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.10,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\i1}What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:48.48,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\i1}The happy memories from back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:51.44,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Here's some omelette rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:54.62,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Ninja Monja guarantees flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:57.28,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Eat up and then come up with \Nall kinds of ideas, and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:02.91,PriPara,Cojiri,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.63,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,I'm home-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:11.45,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,So that Cosmo can eat her beloved eggs every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:13.42,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,I caught one-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:20.51,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Actually, I also got one so I can make\N the chicken rice that you love so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:25.39,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Cosmic Omelette...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:27.35,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,...Rice-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:29.22,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,Together,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:30.27,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,the two of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:33.24,PriPara,Cojiri,0,0,0,,...have made Cosmic Omelette Rice-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:35.28,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,And to top it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:37.61,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajimi's ketchup-bruegel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.01,0:17:47.78,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Cosmic Omelette...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:50.75,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,...Rice-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:56.37,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Looks like the two of them have some new ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:58.61,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to our omelette rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:01.72,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Foodstuffs save the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:04.68,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:08.54,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's the Ajimi vs Cosmo AutDrea Coord Showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:12.48,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,The two of them have finally finished \Ncreating their best coords-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:14.90,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Here we have the final showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.90,0:18:20.53,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now then, let's have the\N famous designer Cosmo's coord-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:26.71,PriPara2,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Here I am! The super gorgeous Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:30.34,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Next is the coord designed by Ajimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:33.05,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelrun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:35.26,PriPara2,Mikan,0,0,0,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:37.76,PriPara2,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mikan wants to eat herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:44.48,PriPara,SignPostThing,0,0,0,,O]h man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:47.93,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,And the final bout has ended in a draw-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:51.12,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:52.69,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Another tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:56.53,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Our match will have to be continued once again-da Vinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:19:01.99,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,But it was a cosmically satisfying match.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.47,0:19:03.89,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,However, Ajimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.58,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,When that day comes, I shall win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:09.54,PriPara,Ajiri,0,0,0,,I won't lose either-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:17.38,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,And the final touches!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:19.63,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajimi's ketchup-bruegel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:27.39,PriPara,Lalatachi,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.39,0:19:29.10,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Portraits of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:31.04,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:34.98,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Thanks to your omelette rice, \Nwe remembered something we'd long forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:39.77,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Back when I shared that one-of-a-kind omelette rice with Ajimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:43.50,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,I was also cosmically dedicated to studying design.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:46.20,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Okay! Okay! Let's all dig in-Rembrandt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:47.77,PriPara2,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:47.77,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:49.41,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:53.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:54.87,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Our charms are glowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.87,0:19:56.68,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Does this mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:19:59.76,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,...the five of us just formed a team for the AuDrea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.38,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:02.84,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:07.43,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,To be able to stand on stage wearing\N my own coord is cosmically surprising!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:11.50,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Surprising-klimt! Sparkling-picasso! DaVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:12.85,PriPara2,Cosmo,0,0,0,,I look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:12.85,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I crayon't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:15.19,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Again...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:21.82,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirei... Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:22.93,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Reona!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:24.57,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aroma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.85,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,They're falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:37.88,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This cosmically annoying individual...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:38.96,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,...goes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.98,0:22:17.60,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Dream Team formed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:19.27,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,We might as well go along with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.27,0:22:23.03,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let's not lose to Phantom Thief Genius or any other team!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:23.65,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:25.86,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I's first Dream Team-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:27.12,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.77,PriPara,Cosmo,0,0,0,,Autumn's Teracosmic GrandPrix!
